msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……………………。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_A1A925CB_1079_4097_9984_F74FFA5128D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eb9f24210f82f6e41c820226069a20148c0d1e2187d0111a6a8d24c6ddd9e138
#. default-sha256: b83b214c74d91f5fcd7e8fb1c22d613a9a22c0b475b6898cbaef0298f1a2b07a
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A1A925CB_1079_4097_9984_F74FFA5128D7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫For far longer than was comfortable, the only sound we heard was the gentle crackling of the "
"fire."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫互いの長すぎる沈黙の中、⟪k:1⟫聞こえるのはぱちぱちという、⟪k:2⟫火の爆ぜる小さな音のみ。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_2FC207D4_5BB8_4F13_8ED3_B5CC837D3D60
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fe2963109c9c55d67376726b529222a44a8cc1886c1331e62709c5255648855a
#. default-sha256: b41f9ab9226eaf47252372686254e4aea96dacf7ab2c9c5460624987eeef3d87
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_2FC207D4_5BB8_4F13_8ED3_B5CC837D3D60"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I had to say something.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I knew that, but what I didn’t know was how to begin."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……口を開かなければならないのは私だ。⟪k:1⟫けれど何から切り出せば良いのか、⟪k:2⟫何を言えば良い"
"のか見当もつかない。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_7636C76B_F264_44A8_B5FB_DAF40CA9AC9B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3c3c991ccb438df3d5b880a85dfc0b7b5b818a8bf9ce86e30b43c74fac8b00bf
#. default-sha256: a7ace2a0b655be19225056af1a5524e65ec8a7f7a5e1c9d94abf691f2a2887c1
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7636C76B_F264_44A8_B5FB_DAF40CA9AC9B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I knew nothing about having an honest, face-to-face discussion with someone about the things "
"we were thinking and feeling."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫人と正面から向き合って、⟪k:1⟫お互いの感情や、⟪k:2⟫思っていることを話し合うやり方が、⟪k:3⟫分か"
"らない。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_4CA04C0A_498A_4B14_8295_73157439C193
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3acb2283156e933ce532ab879874b6014735f0f5e12b04b1207ac20dc7e2b91d
#. default-sha256: aaa7135ea608fa0adbe2bf583bef23ac72f67fbf76b83cd800a381d67ff9d1b6
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_4CA04C0A_498A_4B14_8295_73157439C193"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But that didn’t change anything..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫それでも……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_4CB3629A_C22C_48AF_B79D_4760DD361590
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 72066bf00ab12a8254a18bbb0ed84c686919888850b48fc41aa6ace7035036f1
