#: scenario5:scenario5_1B7D3A1B_862A_42BB_8653_C56AD08FB427
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 485d166e8e87923010be558c2e6e44edaffc4a3c1abc13df66c99bf50206bb58
