msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_22848201_EC36_45E5_986B_B9A9D1A7BF9A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You never so much... ⟪k:2⟫as gave me the time of day before."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫今までずっと……、⟪k:2⟫話を聞いてくれなかったのに？"

#: scenario5:scenario5_E584FF28_B9B3_445B_98B1_EEEF908B5811
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b6c3492dadec9ae6ad9728fd6f2945f4d5731724813672d92935748694eb7150
#. default-sha256: c10779f1c4197cf9a5a706269dfb114c58091a0fe480dd0bcee51253d0da27d8
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_E584FF28_B9B3_445B_98B1_EEEF908B5811"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫………それは………。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_0C4432C5_4125_4ADD_B0B3_F2A8BF3982BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 10c45962b82cecb6448ee0d2b3879df5f9cedc7304c8166a7eb19af82bfcee63
#. default-sha256: 50a5f0bb35ac202626a7e62bc89b419d1111ab004eb30fa70a903b66eda4936c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_0C4432C5_4125_4ADD_B0B3_F2A8BF3982BD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫And I very much doubt...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫you will find what I have to say agreeable."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫それにわたしの言葉は、⟪k:2⟫きっと……、⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫あなたにとって都合の悪いことばかりです。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_3A40C90A_CD29_4C3F_8EC8_3B58B76D783A
