msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Giselle resumed her story from the day she fled the mansion,⟪k:3⟫terrified by my "
"behavior."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫彼女はそれから、⟪k:3⟫この館を出た頃の話を始めた。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫私の言動に怯え、⟪k:6⟫逃"
"げだした時の……。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_465D0CDD_7054_422E_80B0_C4435B55D7D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
