msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_DB188B8F_384B_47FB_9517_A4026085414D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There was a deep sadness on her face as she described that night in the rain, listening to "
"the thunder, when she gave up on living."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫雷鳴と豪雨の中、⟪k:1⟫一度は生を諦めたと言った時の彼女の表情は――深すぎる悲哀の色を映し出してい"
"た。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_207D7A3B_B05F_4879_B38B_922564064D29
