msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She then told me of the time she spent in the nearby village.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫How, at first, life "
"had seemed wonderful,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫それから……、⟪k:1⟫彼女が近隣の村で生活をし始めた時の話も、⟪k:2⟫聞いた。⟪k:3⟫最初こそ、⟪k:4⟫幸"
"福に思えたその生活も――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_0C1B7CEC_699D_4293_9562_1471CC61515C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
